.mdx","Identidad inicial y autenticación","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-54/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_53":249},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_29":251,"_36":47,"_31":252,"_41":253,"_50":-7,"_11":254,"_51":255},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-54/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_53":256},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_29":258,"_36":47,"_31":259,"_41":260,"_50":-7,"_11":261,"_51":262},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-54/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_53":263},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_29":265,"_36":47,"_31":266,"_41":267,"_50":-7,"_11":268,"_51":269},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-54/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_53":270},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_29":272,"_36":47,"_31":273,"_41":274,"_50":-7,"_11":275,"_51":276},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-54/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_53":277},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_29":279,"_36":47,"_31":280,"_41":281,"_50":-7,"_11":282,"_51":283},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instal